course: dictionary
lesson: 3446
title: Facial: words about the face
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Facial is an adjective. It tells you that something is of or on the face. You can spot the clue: the word face is hiding inside facial. «In sign languages, facial expressions are part of the grammar: raised eyebrows can turn a sentence into a yes/no question.» Eyebrows are on the face, so facial expressions must be the movements of the face that show meaning or feelings.
explain: Use the swap check. Replace facial with of the face and see if the sentence still makes sense. «Facial expressions» becomes «expressions of the face», and that works. «Facial hair» becomes «hair on the face», which also works. If the swap makes sense, you have the right meaning.
explain: Facial can also be a noun. A facial is a beauty treatment where the skin of the face is cleaned and creamed. You may see this word at a salon, where someone says, «I'm having a facial today.» Look at the words around it: is it describing something, or is it the name of a thing? That tells you which kind of word it is.
fact: Facial means of or on the face.
fact: A facial expression is how your face shows feelings, such as smiling or frowning.
fact: Facial recognition is technology that knows people by their faces.
fact: A facial is a beauty treatment where the skin of the face is cleaned and creamed.
fact: In sign languages, raised eyebrows can change the meaning of a sentence, so facial expressions are part of the grammar.
exercise: «Her facial expression showed she was surprised.» What does facial mean here? | Of a car | *Of the face | Of the feet | Of the weather
exercise: Ayesha says, «I'm having a facial at the salon.» What is a facial here? | *A beauty treatment where the skin of the face is cleaned and creamed | A test at the doctor's for sore eyes | A type of face paint for a play
exercise: A phone unlocks when it sees your face and knows it is you. What is this called? | A facial | Facial injury | *Facial recognition | Facial hair
test: Science class is learning about the facial muscles that move the mouth and eyes. What does facial mean in facial muscles? | Of the heart | *Of the face | Of the arm | Of the sea
test: The doctor checks for facial injuries after the fall. Which word tells you the injuries are on the face? | Injuries | Doctor | Checks | *Facial
exam: Which of these is a facial expression? | Running a race | *Raising one eyebrow | Walking home quickly | Eating a pear
